//res.cloudinary.com/dwssynxlw/image/upload/v1765974599/vir-group/team/vir-group/team/veerabhai-1765974595862.jpg`,quote:`Our strength lies in our unwavering commitment to quality, integrity, and the trust our customers place in us.`,message:`From its roots in Malad, every VIR project, including its landmark VIR Paradise, reflects a commitment to quality and an understanding of what makes a house a home. The customer-centric approach Veerabhai Prajapati set from day one remains the foundation of the group.`,story:[`Founded in 2013, VIR Group set out to create quality homes in Malad. That vision has grown into a legacy of trust, craftsmanship and innovation across Mumbai.`,`Over more than a decade the group has built more than structures: communities where families settle, grow and stay.`,`Today VIR Group operates through Global Housing Ventures, Parth Life Space, Digicon Developers and JKD Engineering and Infrastructure.`],vision:[`To be Mumbai’s most`,`trusted real estate partner.`],visionText:`A future where every family finds its home, every community thrives, and every structure stands for quality and timeless design.`,mission:[`Creating homes`,`that inspire life.`],missionText:`Exceptional residential and commercial spaces built on integrity, quality craftsmanship and customer satisfaction.`,address:`B-605, Express Zone, Western Express Highway, near Oberoi Mall, Panch Bawadi, Malad East, Mumbai 400063`,hours:`Monday to Saturday, 10am to 7pm. Closed Sunday.`,phone:`+919326287741`,phoneDisplay:`+91 93262 87741`,email:`virgroupmumbai@gmail.com`,whatsapp:`https://wa.me/919326287741`,mapsUrl:`https://www.google.com/maps?q=19.1766679,72.8580976`,careersUrl:`https://www.virgroup.in/careers`,privacyUrl:`https://www.virgroup.in/privacy`,termsUrl:`https://www.virgroup.in/terms`,geo:[19.1767,72.8581],social:[{label:`Instagram`,href:`https://www.instagram.com/vir.group`},{label:`LinkedIn`,href:`https://www.linkedin.com/company/virgroup`},{label:`Facebook`,href:`https://www.facebook.com/virgroupofcompaniesmalad`}]},Sg=[{id:`years`,value:13,suffix:`+`,label:`Years building in Mumbai`,source:`virgroup.in/about`,verified:!0},{id:`families`,value:100,suffix:`+`,label:`Families at home`,source:`virgroup.in/about`,verified:!1,note:`About page says 100+, homepage says 500+.`},{id:`area`,value:1.5,decimals:1,suffix:`M+`,label:`Square feet completed`,source:`virgroup.in/about timeline (2025)`,verified:!1}],Cg=[{year:2013,title:`Foundation`,text:`Established with a vision to transform Mumbai.`,verified:!0},{year:2016,title:`Expansion`,text:`Completed five residential projects across Mumbai.`,verified:!1},{year:2020,title:`Milestone`,text:`Delivered projects for more than 50 families.`,verified:!1},{year:2022,title:`Innovation`,text:`Introduced eco-friendly construction practices.`,verified:!1},{year:2023,title:`Recognition`,text:`Recognised for excellence in real estate development.`,verified:!1},{year:2025,title:`Legacy`,text:`1,500,000+ sq ft completed and 100+ families at home.`,verified:!1}],wg=[{name:`Integrity`,text:`Conducting business with honesty and transparency.`},{name:`Excellence`,text:`An uncompromising commitment to quality.`},{name:`Customer first`,text:`Building relationships that last.`},{name:`Innovation`,text:`Embracing progress while respecting tradition.`},{name:`Trust`,text:`Earning confidence through consistent delivery.`},{name:`Care`,text:`Treating every project as our own home.`}],Tg=[{name:`Global Housing Ventures`,category:`Real estate development`},{name:`JKD Engineering and Infrastructure`,category:`Real estate development`},{name:`Parth Life Space`,category:`Real estate development`},{name:`Digicon Developers`,category:`Real estate development`},{name:`Viru Gems`,category:`Luxury gems and jewellery`,needsReview:!0}],Eg=[{label:`Projects`,href:`/projects`},{label:`About`,href:`/about`},{label:`Team`,href:`/team`},{label:`Careers`,href:`/careers`},{label:`Contact`,href:`/contact`}],Dg={"Borivali West":[19.2307,72.8467],"Malad West":[19.187,72.8372],"Malad East":[19.1866,72.86],"Goregaon East":[19.165,72.861],"Vile Parle":[19.099,72.848],Santacruz:[19.081,72.841]},Og={slug:`opportunity`,name:`Codename Opportunity`,shortName:`Opportunity`,area:`Malad East`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`ongoing`,tagline:`Codename Opportunity is more than a residence—it's an address crafted for those who choose elegance, exclusivity, and a lifestyle beyond expectations.`,statement:[`An address crafted`,`beyond expectations.`],configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],carpetArea:`1199999 sq.ft`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/opportunity.webp`,alt:`Codename Opportunity, Malad East, Mumbai`,artisticImpression:!0},aboutHeading:`About This Property`,aboutLead:`Codename Opportunity is an exclusive luxury residential destination thoughtfully designed for those who appreciate refined living and timeless elegance. Located in the fast-growing neighborhood of Malad East, Mumbai, the development combines contemporary architecture, spacious residences, and thoughtfully curated amenities to create a lifestyle that is both sophisticated and serene.`,aboutParagraphs:[`Codename Opportunity is an exclusive luxury residential destination thoughtfully designed for those who appreciate refined living and timeless elegance. Located in the fast-growing neighborhood of Malad East, Mumbai, the development combines contemporary architecture, spacious residences, and thoughtfully curated amenities to create a lifestyle that is both sophisticated and serene.`,`Spread across a 2-acre integrated podium, the project features four iconic G+45 residential towers, offering expansive homes crafted with exceptional attention to detail. Every space has been designed to enhance natural light, comfort, and functionality, creating an environment where everyday living feels effortless and inspiring.`,`Beyond its impressive architecture, Codename Opportunity offers a carefully curated lifestyle with premium amenities, landscaped open spaces, and seamless connectivity to the city's major destinations. It is a place where luxury is expressed through thoughtful design, peaceful surroundings, and experiences that enrich everyday life.`,`More than just a residential address, Codename Opportunity is a landmark that reflects modern aspirations, combining exclusivity, convenience, and lasting value for families seeking an elevated way of life.`],description:`Codename Opportunity is an exclusive luxury residential destination thoughtfully designed for those who appreciate refined living and timeless elegance. Located in the fast-growing neighborhood of Malad East, Mumbai, the development combines contemporary architecture, spacious residences, and thoughtfully curated amenities to create a lifestyle that is both sophisticated and serene.`,highlights:[{label:`Integrated Podium`,value:`2-Acre integrated podium`},{label:`Tower Structure`,value:`4 Iconic G+45 residential towers`},{label:`Carpet Area`,value:`1199999 sq.ft`},{label:`Configurations`,value:`1, 2 & 3 BHK`}],specifications:[{label:`Property Type`,value:`Luxury Residential Development`},{label:`Carpet Area`,value:`1199999 sq.ft`},{label:`Configurations`,value:`1-2-3 BHK`},{label:`Land Parcel`,value:`2-Acre integrated podium`},{label:`Tower Elevation`,value:`4 Iconic G+45 Residential Towers`},{label:`Location`,value:`Malad East, Mumbai`},{label:`Status`,value:`Under development`},{label:`Developer`,value:`VIR Group`}],facts:[{label:`Carpet Area`,value:`1199999 sq.ft`,verified:!0},{label:`Integrated Podium`,value:`2-Acre integrated podium`,verified:!0},{label:`Towers`,value:`4 Iconic G+45 Towers`,verified:!0},{label:`Configuration`,value:`1-2-3 BHK`,verified:!0},{label:`Location`,value:`Malad East, Mumbai`,verified:!0}],amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Gym`,`Swimming Pool`,`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`WiFi`,`Garden/Park`,`Clubhouse`,`Kids Play Area`,`Gas Pipeline`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Power Backup`,`Elevator`,`Shopping Center`,`CCTV Surveillance`,`Sports Facility`,`Visitor Parking`,`Medical Facility`,`Cafeteria`,`Library`,`Party Hall`]},mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d15072.962082248549!2d72.83720033065583!3d19.184694333623547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b7b834ff28e9%3A0x9f6fd34672620c06!2sVIR%20GROUP!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272886115!5m2!1sen!2sin`,elevation:{floors:42,towerWidth:260,columns:8},disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:{title:`Codename Opportunity | 1, 2 & 3 BHK Luxury Residences Malad East | VIR Group`,description:`Codename Opportunity by VIR Group in Malad East, Mumbai. 1, 2 & 3 BHK luxury residences across 4 iconic G+45 towers on a 2-acre podium with 20 premium amenities.`}},kg={slug:`vir-paradise`,name:`VIR Paradise`,area:`Malad West`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`ongoing`,tagline:`Unlock the key of extraordinary living!`,statement:[`Unlock the key of`,`extraordinary living.`],configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],rera:`P51800079526`,carpetArea:`172999 sq.ft`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3768.2420076269514!2d72.84492517425461!3d19.184629348555127!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b700157ea951%3A0xbfd8cf3b5dec10eb!2sVIR%20Paradise!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272806458!5m2!1sen!2sin`,cutout:`/media/home-project/vir-paradise-image--1765981006207-4894.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/paradise.png`,alt:`VIR Paradise, Malad West`,artisticImpression:!0},description:`VIR Paradise is a premium residential development by VIR Group, thoughtfully crafted to offer an elevated lifestyle in the heart of Malad West, Mumbai. Designed with a perfect blend of elegance, comfort, and contemporary architecture, the project stands as a symbol of refined urban living.`,aboutParagraphs:[`VIR Paradise is a premium residential development by VIR Group, thoughtfully crafted to offer an elevated lifestyle in the heart of Malad West, Mumbai. Designed with a perfect blend of elegance, comfort, and contemporary architecture, the project stands as a symbol of refined urban living.`,`Rising gracefully amidst a well-established neighborhood, VIR Paradise offers luxuriously designed residences with efficient layouts, ample natural light, and superior finishes. Every home is planned to provide a sense of openness, privacy, and functionality, catering to the aspirations of modern urban families.`,`One of the highlights of VIR Paradise is its exclusive rooftop lifestyle amenities, curated to provide residents with serene spaces to unwind and rejuvenate. From landscaped leisure zones and yoga spaces to fitness and relaxation areas, the rooftop is designed as a private retreat above the city.`,`The project features a grand entrance lobby, premium common areas, and thoughtfully planned interiors that reflect quality craftsmanship and attention to detail. High standards of construction, modern safety systems, and essential conveniences ensure a secure and comfortable living environment.`,`Strategically located in Malad West, VIR Paradise enjoys excellent connectivity to major roads, business hubs, schools, hospitals, shopping destinations, and entertainment zones. The location offers the perfect balance between urban accessibility and residential tranquility.`,`VIR Paradise is more than just a residence—it is a destination where thoughtful design, modern comforts, and a prime location come together to create a truly enriching living experience.`],amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`Clubhouse`,`Kids Play Area`,`Gas Pipeline`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Power Backup`,`Elevator`]},elevation:{floors:23,towerWidth:200,columns:6,crown:!0},featured:!0,disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:{title:`VIR Paradise, Malad West | 1, 2 and 3 BHK Homes | VIR Group`,description:`VIR Paradise by VIR Group in Malad West, Mumbai. 1, 2 and 3 BHK residences with exclusive rooftop retreat. MahaRERA No. P51800079526.`}},Ag=(e,t,n)=>({title:`${e}, ${t} | VIR Group`,description:`${e} by VIR Group in ${t}, Mumbai.${n?` ${n} homes.`:``}`}),jg=[Og,kg,{slug:`vir-vinayanand`,legacySlugs:[`virvinayanand`],name:`VIR Vinayanand`,area:`Santacruz`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`ongoing`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3768.4240386995816!2d72.85552267425444!3d19.1766729488062!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b7b834ff28e9%3A0x9f6fd34672620c06!2sVIR%20GROUP!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272610508!5m2!1sen!2sin`,configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],elevation:{floors:7,towerWidth:190,columns:5,crown:!0},cutout:`/media/home-project/untitled-design2.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/vinayanand.png`,alt:`VIR Vinayanand, Santacruz`,artisticImpression:!0},description:`Coming Soon! Premium residential development in Santacruz, Mumbai by VIR Group.`,aboutParagraphs:[`Coming Soon!`],disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:Ag(`VIR Vinayanand`,`Santacruz`,`1, 2 and 3 BHK`)},{slug:`vir-enclave`,name:`VIR Enclave`,area:`Borivali West`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`available`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3767.338218739854!2d72.8423567742557!3d19.224086147308817!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b1000a3e6001%3A0xd294fd9cb1c0caa9!2sVir%20Enclave%20By%20Vir%20Group!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272691392!5m2!1sen!2sin`,configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],featured:!0,rera:`P51800049641`,carpetArea:`47300 sq.ft`,tagline:`Thoughtfully planned homes that combine modern living with everyday convenience.`,statement:[`Thoughtfully planned`,`modern living.`],description:`Looking for a well-designed apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai? VIR Enclave, a residential project by VIR Group, offers thoughtfully planned homes that combine modern living with everyday convenience.`,aboutParagraphs:[`Looking for a well-designed apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai? VIR Enclave, a residential project by VIR Group, offers thoughtfully planned homes that combine modern living with everyday convenience.`,`Spread across 0.12 acres, VIR Enclave is an under-construction residential development comprising one exclusive building with only 9 residential units, ensuring privacy and a peaceful living environment. The project offers 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK apartments, with unit sizes ranging from 372 sq. ft. to 989 sq. ft., designed for efficient space utilization and comfortable living.`,`Strategically located at Kastur Park, Shimpoli, Borivali West, VIR Enclave enjoys excellent connectivity to major parts of Mumbai. The project was launched in February 2023 and is progressing as per approved timelines.`,`VIR Enclave provides essential lifestyle amenities, including closed car parking, catering to the daily needs of modern homeowners. Every feature has been carefully planned to meet the expectations of today’s discerning homebuyers.`,`The project is RERA-registered and fully compliant, with RERA ID: P51800049641, ensuring transparency and trust.`,`Borivali West is a well-established residential hub with seamless road connectivity. Leading shopping malls, cinemas, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and daily conveniences are located in close proximity, making VIR Enclave an ideal choice for comfortable urban living.`],elevation:{floors:17,towerWidth:270,columns:8},cutout:`/media/home-project/vir-enclave-image--1765980809964-5631.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/VIR-Enclave.png`,alt:`VIR Enclave, Borivali West`,artisticImpression:!0},amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`Kids Play Area`,`Gas Pipeline`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Power Backup`,`Elevator`,`CCTV Surveillance`]},disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:Ag(`VIR Enclave`,`Borivali West`,`1, 2 and 3 BHK`)},{slug:`global-residency`,legacySlugs:[`globalresidency`],name:`Global Residency`,area:`Goregaon`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`available`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3768.693298248183!2d72.85397557425415!3d19.164898049177516!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b70ce63ba081%3A0x2df6efe0a4fc009d!2sGlobal%20Residency!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272930134!5m2!1sen!2sin`,configurations:[`1`,`2`],featured:!0,rera:`P51800009478`,carpetArea:`47300 sq.ft`,tagline:`Where Comfort Meets Connectivity`,statement:[`Where comfort`,`meets connectivity.`],description:`Global Residency is a well-planned residential development located in Goregaon, one of Mumbai’s prominent and well-connected suburbs. The project offers a thoughtfully curated range of amenities designed to enhance comfort, convenience, and quality of life for its residents.`,aboutParagraphs:[`Global Residency is a well-planned residential development located in Goregaon, one of Mumbai’s prominent and well-connected suburbs. The project offers a thoughtfully curated range of amenities designed to enhance comfort, convenience, and quality of life for its residents.`,`Strategically situated within the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, Global Residency enjoys excellent connectivity to key commercial hubs and lifestyle destinations. The surrounding area is home to several renowned schools, colleges, hospitals, and essential services, all located within close proximity, ensuring ease of daily living for families.`,`With its balanced blend of modern amenities and a prime location, Global Residency presents an ideal choice for those seeking a comfortable and well-connected urban lifestyle.`],elevation:{floors:10,towerWidth:210,columns:5,crown:!0},cutout:`/media/home-project/global-residency-image--1765980481155-8069.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/globli-residency.png`,alt:`Global Residency, Goregaon`,artisticImpression:!0},amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`Kids Play Area`,`Clubhouse`,`Garden/Park`,`Elevator`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Gas Pipeline`,`CCTV Surveillance`]},disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:Ag(`Global Residency`,`Goregaon`,`1 and 2 BHK`)},{slug:`vir-krishna-koyna`,legacySlugs:[`krishnakoyna`],name:`VIR Krishna Koyna`,area:`Mankhurd`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`available`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3767.342674857535!2d72.8425981242556!3d19.223891797314913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7b1058b457809%3A0x1b55d3616bdc6da3!2sKrishna%20Koyna!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272762385!5m2!1sen!2sin`,configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],featured:!0,rera:`P51800027749`,carpetArea:`48599 sq.ft`,tagline:`ADD DIVINITY TO YOUR LIFESTYLE`,statement:[`Add divinity to`,`your lifestyle.`],description:`VIR Krishna Koyna is a thoughtfully planned residential project located in Mankhurd, Mumbai, offering well-designed homes that blend comfort, functionality, and urban convenience. The project is spread across 0.22 acres, ensuring a well-organized and efficient residential layout.`,aboutParagraphs:[`VIR Krishna Koyna is a thoughtfully planned residential project located in Mankhurd, Mumbai, offering well-designed homes that blend comfort, functionality, and urban convenience. The project is spread across 0.22 acres, ensuring a well-organized and efficient residential layout.`,`VIR Krishna Koyna offers premium apartment configurations, including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK residences, designed to cater to the diverse needs of modern families. As per the approved area plan, apartment sizes start from 369 sq. ft., providing optimal space utilization and comfortable living.`,`The project is currently under construction and comprises one residential building with a total of 16 exclusive units, ensuring privacy and a close-knit community environment. The development is equipped with fire protection and fire safety systems in compliance with statutory norms and includes closed car parking facilities for residents.`,`VIR Krishna Koyna promises a class-apart lifestyle, combining quality construction with essential modern amenities. The project has received bank finance approvals from leading institutions, including HDFC, LIC Housing Finance, and Punjab National Bank, making home ownership easier and more accessible.`,`The project complies with all regulations mandated by the state authority and is RERA registered under RERA ID: P51800027749, ensuring transparency and trust.`,`Strategically located in Mankhurd, the project enjoys excellent connectivity to key business hubs, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and recreational destinations, making it an ideal choice for urban living.`],elevation:{floors:10,towerWidth:300,columns:9},cutout:`/media/home-project/krishna-koyna-image-.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/Krishna-Koyana.png`,alt:`VIR Krishna Koyna, Mankhurd`,artisticImpression:!0},amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`Garden/Park`,`Clubhouse`,`Kids Play Area`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Gas Pipeline`,`Elevator`,`Power Backup`]},disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change. Please verify with our sales team before making decisions.`,seo:Ag(`VIR Krishna Koyna`,`Mankhurd`,`1, 2 and 3 BHK`)},{slug:`surya-prakash`,legacySlugs:[`suryaprakash`],name:`Surya Prakash`,area:`Vile Parle`,city:`Mumbai`,status:`ongoing`,mapEmbed:`https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3770.3625348452906!2d72.84136137425216!3d19.091745251479907!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3be7c9ae40c4ab9b%3A0x3a0f948dc777e56e!2sSurya%20Prakash%20CHS%20Ltd!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1791272972377!5m2!1sen!2sin`,configurations:[`1`,`2`,`3`],featured:!0,rera:`P51800050331`,carpetArea:`69399 sq.ft`,tagline:`Blend of convenience, comfort, and connectivity.`,statement:[`Convenience, comfort`,`and connectivity.`],description:`Surya Prakash by VIR Group is thoughtfully designed to offer a refined living experience, combining comfort, convenience, and modern amenities to enhance everyday life.`,aboutParagraphs:[`Surya Prakash by VIR Group is thoughtfully designed to offer a refined living experience, combining comfort, convenience, and modern amenities to enhance everyday life.`,`Residents can enjoy a fully equipped fitness center, enabling them to maintain an active and healthy lifestyle without leaving the comfort of their home. A dedicated children’s play area provides a safe and engaging environment for younger residents to play and socialize.`,`The project features beautifully landscaped gardens, offering serene green spaces for relaxation, leisure walks, and outdoor activities. To ensure complete peace of mind, Surya Prakash is equipped with 24/7 security and CCTV surveillance, maintaining a safe and secure residential environment at all times.`,`For recreation and social engagement, residents have access to indoor games facilities, including options such as table tennis and carrom. A multipurpose hall is also available, suitable for hosting community gatherings, celebrations, and private events.`,`The development includes ample parking facilities for both residents and visitors, ensuring convenience and ease of access. Additionally, power backup systems are in place to provide uninterrupted electricity during outages.`,`At Surya Prakash, every amenity has been carefully planned to deliver a balanced lifestyle that reflects quality, functionality, and modern urban living.`],elevation:{floors:8,towerWidth:180,columns:4,crown:!0},cutout:`/media/home-project/untitled-design.avif`,hero:{src:`/media/projects/project-detail/surya-prakash.png`,alt:`Surya Prakash, Vile Parle`,artisticImpression:!0},amenities:{verified:!0,items:[`Gym`,`Parking`,`24/7 Security`,`Garden/Park`,`Kids Play Area`,`24x7 Water Supply`,`Elevator`,`CCTV Surveillance`]},disclaimer:`Important: All details are subject to change.